msgstr "截图内容始终保持在视觉中心；常用标注工具悬浮在画布侧边，属性按上下文显示。"

msgid "The first recognition never downloads a model automatically; download and enable one manually on the OCR Models page."
msgstr "首次识别不会自动下载模型；模型必须在 OCR 模型页手动下载并启用。"

msgid "The tray icon is Azusa Lens's persistent entry point for opening settings or starting a region capture."
msgstr "托盘图标是 Azusa Lens 的常驻入口，可打开主界面或直接开始区域截图。"

