msgstr "识别场景"

msgid "Configure a model for each recognition scenario. Only compatible models can be assigned."
msgstr "为不同识别场景分别配置模型，仅可选择支持该场景的模型。"

msgid "Text recognition"
msgstr "文字识别"

msgid "General OCR for screenshots and images, with text regions that remain selectable and copyable."
msgstr "用于截图和图片的通用 OCR，识别后的文字区域可继续选择和复制。"

msgid "Document parsing"
msgstr "文档解析"

msgid "Parse complete pages into Markdown while preserving reading order and document structure."
msgstr "将完整文档页面解析为 Markdown，并尽量保留阅读顺序和文档结构。"

msgid "Table recognition"
msgstr "表格识别"

msgid "Extract tables into structured Markdown while preserving rows, columns and cells."
msgstr "将表格提取为结构化 Markdown，并尽量保留行、列和单元格关系。"

msgid "Figure parsing"
msgstr "图形解析"

msgid "Understand charts, figures and diagrams beyond plain-text OCR."
msgstr "理解图表、Figure 和示意图等超出纯文字 OCR 的视觉内容。"

msgid "File manager integration"
msgstr "文件管理器集成"

msgid "Registered"
msgstr "已注册"

msgid "Not supported on this platform"
msgstr "当前平台暂不支持"

msgid "Register"
msgstr "注册"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgid "OCR models"
msgstr "OCR 模型"

msgid "Download a model, then assign it to the recognition scenarios it supports."
msgstr "先下载模型，再将其分配到支持的识别场景。"

msgid "Fastest PP-OCRv6 tier for low-resource local OCR."
msgstr "PP-OCRv6 最轻量档，速度优先，适合低资源本地 OCR。"

msgid "Balanced PP-OCRv6 tier for everyday desktop OCR."
msgstr "PP-OCRv6 均衡档，兼顾速度与精度，适合日常桌面 OCR。"

msgid "Accuracy-first PP-OCRv6 tier for high-quality local OCR in complex text scenes."
msgstr "PP-OCRv6 精度优先档，适合复杂文字场景下的高质量本地 OCR。"

msgid "0.9B multimodal OCR for complex document understanding, strong in tables, formulas and information extraction."
msgstr "0.9B 多模态 OCR，面向复杂文档理解，擅长表格、公式和信息抽取。"

msgid "Multimodal OCR with grounded text recognition, document-to-Markdown and figure parsing."
msgstr "多模态 OCR，支持带定位的文字识别、文档转 Markdown 和图形解析。"

msgid "Used by one or more OCR types"
msgstr "已用于一个或多个识别场景"

