msgid "Current file OCR accepts PNG, JPEG, WebP, BMP and TIFF. PDF input is intentionally not exposed until the document pipeline supports it end-to-end."
msgstr "当前文件识别支持 PNG、JPEG、WebP、BMP 和 TIFF；在文档管线端到端支持 PDF 前暂不开放 PDF 输入。"

msgid "Recognize file"
msgstr "识别文件"
